This project contains a synthesis and rewritten adaptations of
methods documented by Matt Pocock (grilling), Leonxlnx (taste-skill), Open Design
contributors (OpenDesign), Next Level Builder (UI UX Pro Max), and Anthropic
(frontend-design, via OpenDesign), with ideas from Impeccable. It merges the
project owner's own design-review-loop skill, including its scripts and tests.

The adaptation reorganizes these methods into product discovery, visual
directions chosen by looking, craft guidance for websites, web apps, dashboards,
mobile and AI products, real workflow/data contracts, and evidence-based review.
Adaptation dates: 2026-10-19 and 2026-10-26. These are rewritten integration documents, not
unaltered upstream skill files. The Python scanner, gate and tests were written by the
project owner; upstream source code, datasets, media and private project
materials are not bundled.

